{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12243070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12243070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1224307001:1":{"text":"辛巴达，你们讨论的结果怎么样？答应了吗？","source_cn":"辛巴达，你们讨论的结果怎么样？答应了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA701246AE896F1D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224307002:1":{"text":"当然。对村里人来说，贝拉开的条件很难拒绝。","source_cn":"当然。对村里人来说，贝拉开的条件很难拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5434DE3C98BD244E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224307003:1":{"text":"不过有条件。必须要等对泰西欧的审判结束后，她们才愿意帮忙，她们只帮这一次。至于长期合作嘛——之后再说。","source_cn":"不过有条件。必须要等对泰西欧的审判结束后，她们才愿意帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BEC727E700218AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224307004:1":{"text":"没问题。","source_cn":"没问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FDDBE62C9DBF685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224307005:1":{"text":"爽快！血薇帮准备什么时候审判泰西欧？","source_cn":"爽快！血薇帮准备什么时候审判泰西欧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43936129AFDFEA40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say: